        "text": "You may ask, why do we need stablecoins? Well, we know that crypto prices are very volatile. Suppose you put up some bitcoin as collateral to borrow $1,000. If Bitcoin price goes down a lot, your lender may become nervous and ask you to put up more bitcoin as collateral. Or sell your bitcoin so that the lender can get the money back. If you can use cryptos with relatively stable prices as collateral, then this problem can be alleviated. The need for cryptos with price stability exists in most crypto transactions. That's why stablecoins are a vital component of the DEFI ecosystem. Now that we know what stablecoins are, let's go into crypto borrowing and lending, which is among the most popular applications in the DEFI space.",
        "start": 960,
        "end": 44810,
        "confidence": 0.9919198,
        "channel": null,
